        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 adds support for some  <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCInboundRtpStreamStats\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCInboundRtpStreamStats</code></a>. This adds the release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The docs for the properties listed in this are added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3251259558\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40495\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40495/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40495\">#40495</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249075657\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40478\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40478/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40478\">#40478</a></p>",
