        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF142 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Animation/commitStyles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Animation/commitStyles()</code></a> allows animations to capture the final styles without specifying a <code class=\"notranslate\">fill</code> in latest spec  - in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1973203\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1973203</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3249106813\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40482\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40482/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40482\">#40482</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40611",
            "title": "FF142 Relnote Animation.commitStyles no longer requires fill",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-04T02:10:49.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-04T02:08:35.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "hamishwillee",
                "url": "https://github.com/hamishwillee"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">After <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3207883044\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40228\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40228/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40228\">#40228</a>, we are a lot more explicit on some CSS stylistic decisions. This PR fixes two basic things: comments should start and end with a space, and the use of <code class=\"notranslate\">from</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">to</code> selectors should follow our style guide.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40608",
            "title": "Lint: spaces around CSS comments, from/to keyframe selectors",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-03T15:51:51.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-03T15:49:56.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
                "url": "https://github.com/Josh-Cena"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">After <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3207883044\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40228\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40228/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40228\">#40228</a>, we are a lot more explicit on some CSS stylistic decisions. This PR makes sure that all CSS identifiers use <code class=\"notranslate\">kebab-case</code>, while SVG value keywords use camelCase (mostly <code class=\"notranslate\">currentColor</code>).</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40603",
            "title": "Lint: identifiers should use kebab-case",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-03T07:00:45.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-03T06:58:23.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
                "url": "https://github.com/Josh-Cena"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">After <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3207883044\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40228\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40228/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40228\">#40228</a>, we are a lot more explicit on some CSS stylistic decisions. This PR adds double quotes to all <code class=\"notranslate\">url()</code> functions, and changes <code class=\"notranslate\">@import url(...)</code> to <code class=\"notranslate\">@import \"...\"</code>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40601",
            "title": "Lint: add quotes for all url() arguments",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-03T06:59:28.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-03T06:27:36.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Josh-Cena",
